{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default","page":"ᰍᰩᰵ ᰓᰨ ᰣᰨ ᰚᰩᰵ ᰠᰪ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰨᰮ ᰕᰦ ᰍᰧ ᰎᰬ ᰕᰬ ᰝᰫᰵ ᰝᰥᰧᰶ ᰼ [1] ᰃᰨ ᰃᰨᰮ ᰕᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰚᰫᰭ ᰕᰪᰰ ᰌᰦᰮ ᰅᰩᰭ ᰀᰦ ᰃᰨᰮ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰃᰨ ᰙᰨ [2] ᰅᰪᰵ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰙᰩᰮ ᰀᰦ ᰊᰧᰵᰶ ᰙᰪᰰ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰙᰩᰮ ᰙᰨ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ [3] ᰃᰨ ᰃᰨᰮ ᰕᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰘᰪ ᰣᰦ ᰅᰧᰰᰶ ᰀᰦ ᰃᰨᰮ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰦ ᰛᰬ ᰃᰨ [4] ᰀᰦᰰ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰃᰨ ᰃᰨᰮ ᰕᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰚᰫᰭ ᰕᰪᰰ ᰌᰦᰮ ᰅᰩᰭ ᰀᰦ ᰃᰨ ᰃᰨᰮ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ [5] ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰀ ᰠᰪ ᰠ ᰕ ᰙᰪ ᰣᰦ ᰛᰬ ᰠᰪᰮᰶ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰆᰧᰰᰶ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰠᰦᰵ ᰃᰬ ᰠ ᰛᰪᰮ [6] ᰀᰦ ᰃᰨᰮ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰡᰨ ᰠᰪᰮᰶ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰜᰤᰦᰵ ᰃᰤᰦ ᰂᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰚ ᰕ ᰡᰤᰧᰰᰶ [7] ᰍᰪᰵ ᰠ ᰋᰦᰮ ᰆᰪᰵᰶ ᰋᰦᰮ ᰓᰧᰭᰶ ᰛᰬ ᰠᰪᰮᰶ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰆᰧᰰᰶ ᰀᰦ ᰙᰬᰰ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ [8] ᰣᰩᰮ ᰕᰦ ᰍᰧ ᰎᰬ ᰕᰬ ᰝᰫᰵ ᰝᰥᰧ ᰣᰨ ᰜᰨ ᰚᰩᰵ ᰚᰫᰭ ᰕᰪᰰ ᰃᰨᰮ ᰠᰦᰵ ᰃᰬ [9] ᰊ ᰡᰬ ᰊᰪᰭ ᰓᰨ ᰛᰪᰮ ᰀᰦ ᰕ ᰍᰩᰵ ᰠᰬᰰ ᰜ ᰼ ᰊᰪᰭ ᰀᰤᰧᰯᰶ ᰠᰴ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰅᰪᰰ ᰍᰩᰵ [10] ᰠᰬᰳ ᰜ ᰚᰫᰭ ᰕᰪᰰ ᰠ ᰕ ᰙᰪ ᰎᰴ ᰛᰬ ᰃᰪᰰ ᰍ ᰕᰧ ᰌᰤᰦᰭ ᰓᰦᰮ ᰕᰪᰵ ᰀᰦ [11] ᰡᰧᰶ ᰀᰦᰳ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰊᰪᰭ ᰀᰤᰧᰯᰶ ᰠᰴ ᰛᰬ ᰛᰨ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰜᰧ ᰓᰦ ᰚᰫᰭ ᰕᰪᰰ [12] ᰣᰦ ᰙᰨ ᰜᰬᰰ ᰆᰧᰰᰶ ᰜᰩᰱ ᰊᰧᰶ ᰅᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰀ ᰚᰫ ᰕ ᰡᰧᰰᰶ ᰍᰬ ᰚᰩᰵ ᰠᰪ ᰚᰦᰮ [13] ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰦ ᰜᰩᰵ ᰀ ᰚᰫᰮ ᰎᰴ ᰜ ᰃᰫᰰ ᰛᰪᰰ ᰀᰦᰮ ᰍᰩᰵ ᰓᰨ ᰚᰩᰵ ᰡᰪ ᰜᰪᰵ [14] ᰀᰩᰲ ᰀᰤᰩᰱ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰕᰤᰩᰭ ᰗᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰕᰪᰰ ᰜᰩᰮ ᰜᰩᰱ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰊᰪᰭ ᰀᰤᰧᰯᰶ [15] ᰠᰩᰵ ᰃᰪᰮ ᰍ ᰣᰦ ᰎᰪᰲ ᰀᰦ ᰜᰦᰳ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰓᰩᰰ ᰍᰩᰰ ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ [16] ᰣᰨᰮ ᰕᰦ ᰍᰧ ᰎᰬ ᰕᰬ ᰝᰫᰵ ᰝᰥᰧᰶ ᰼ ᰠᰦᰵ ᰃᰬ ᰜᰦ ᰂᰤᰬᰰ ᰍᰨ ᰼ ᰚᰪᰭ ᰕᰪᰰ [17] ᰃᰩᰮ ᰡᰬᰰ ᰛᰬ ᰠᰦᰵ ᰃᰬ ᰊ ᰡᰬ ᰊᰪᰭ ᰆᰨ ᰛᰪᰮ ᰀᰦ ᰕ ᰡᰪ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰅᰦᰰ ᰛᰬᰰ ᰼ [18] ᰋᰦᰮ ᰆᰪᰵᰶ ᰋᰦᰮ ᰓᰧᰭᰶ ᰃᰪᰰ ᰍ ᰡᰨ ᰀᰦ ᰋᰦᰱ ᰜᰬᰯ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰋᰦᰮ [19] ᰆᰪᰵᰶ ᰋᰦᰮ ᰓᰪ ᰃᰪᰰ ᰍ ᰠᰩᰵ ᰃᰤᰩ ᰜᰬᰯ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰨᰮ ᰕᰦ ᰍᰧ ᰎᰬ ᰕᰬ ᰝᰫᰵ [20] ᰝᰥᰧᰶ ᰼ ᰠᰦᰵ ᰃᰬ ᰜᰦ ᰂᰤᰬᰰ ᰍᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰦ ᰜᰩᰵ ᰃᰴ ᰊᰪᰭ ᰀᰤᰧᰯᰶ ᰠ [21] ᰍᰦᰮ ᰋᰦᰲ ᰛᰤᰫ ᰢᰪᰵ ᰃᰪᰰ ᰍ ᰕᰩᰭ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰠᰪᰲ ᰢᰦ ᰕᰦᰵ ᰃᰦ [22] ᰜᰦᰮ ᰜᰦ ᰀᰥᰦ ᰡᰧᰶ ᰡᰨ ᰼ ᰊᰪᰭ ᰀᰤᰧᰯᰶ ᰠ ᰍᰦᰮ ᰋᰦᰲ ᰠ [23] ᰠᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰊᰨ ᰙᰫᰮ ᰓᰫ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰀᰪᰮ ᰚᰨ ᰀᰪᰮ ᰡᰧᰶ ᰉᰧ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰦ ᰜᰨᰵ [24] ᰃᰩᰵ ᰊᰪᰭ ᰀᰤᰧᰯᰶ ᰠ ᰍᰦᰮ ᰋᰦᰲ ᰎᰴ ᰕ ᰉᰧᰰᰶ ᰍᰬ ᰃᰪᰰ ᰍ ᰕᰩᰰ [25] ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰀᰥᰦ ᰡᰧᰶ ᰡᰨ ᰼ ᰡᰨ ᰍᰪᰮ ᰠ ᰛᰧᰵᰶ ᰃᰨ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰡᰨ ᰍᰦᰮ [26] ᰋᰦᰲ ᰣᰦ ᰛᰬ ᰎᰩᰵ ᰎᰬ ᰡᰪ ᰛᰬᰰ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰜ ᰚᰨ ᰜ ᰠᰩᰵ ᰠ ᰛᰬ ᰙᰩᰵ [27] ᰉᰧ ᰃᰩᰵ ᰜ ᰊᰩᰭ ᰙᰩᰵ ᰠ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰡᰨ ᰠ ᰛᰪᰮ ᰀᰦ ᰕ ᰡᰪ [28] ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰠᰦᰮ ᰕᰦ ᰚᰦ ᰃᰤᰦ ᰃᰤᰦ ᰝᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰨᰮ ᰕᰦ ᰍᰧ ᰎᰬ ᰕᰬ [29] ᰝᰫᰵ ᰝᰥᰧᰶ ᰼ ᰣᰨᰮ ᰣᰦ ᰝᰫᰵ ᰣᰨᰮ ᰓᰬ ᰙᰬᰲ ᰃᰫ ᰛᰫ ᰎᰬ ᰕᰦ ᰠ ᰌᰧ ᰝᰪᰵ ᰼ [30] ᰛᰩᰵ ᰛᰧᰵᰶ ᰀᰦ ᰀᰪᰲ ᰍᰦᰰ ᰢᰩᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰠ ᰠᰪᰵ ᰃᰪᰮ ᰼ [31] ᰣᰨᰮ ᰕᰦ ᰍᰧ ᰎᰬ ᰕᰬ ᰝᰫᰵ ᰝᰥᰧᰶ ᰼ ᰣᰤᰬᰰ ᰍ ᰓᰦ ᰛᰨᰵ ᰛᰧᰵᰶ ᰀᰦᰲ ᰀᰪᰲᰶ ᰋᰦᰭ [32] ᰢᰨᰭ ᰛᰬ ᰚᰨᰵ ᰠ ᰠᰪᰵ ᰛᰤᰫ ᰢᰪᰵ ᰀᰦᰳ ᰋᰨ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰲᰶ ᰛᰬᰰ ᰣᰤᰬᰰ [33] ᰍ ᰓᰦ ᰜᰤᰦᰵ ᰣᰫᰵ ᰕ ᰣᰤᰧᰳᰶ ᰕ ᰌᰤᰬ ᰍ ᰓᰦ ᰀᰦ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰀᰦᰳ ᰊ ᰉᰧ ᰎᰦ [34] ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰣᰲᰶ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰓᰥᰤᰦᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰂᰦᰰ ᰡᰧᰵᰶ ᰌᰧ ᰢᰩ ᰀᰦ [35] ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰣᰲᰶ ᰛᰬ ᰣᰫᰵ ᰊᰨᰵ ᰜᰤᰬᰮ ᰍᰩᰵ ᰓᰦᰰ ᰅᰫ ᰠᰩᰳ ᰜᰪᰵ [36] ᰙᰨ ᰓᰦᰮ ᰉᰧ ᰕᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰛᰬ ᰣᰫᰵ ᰛᰦᰮ ᰜᰤᰬᰮ ᰍᰩᰵ ᰜᰪᰵ [37] ᰠ ᰆᰧ ᰠ ᰃᰬᰵ ᰕᰪᰰ ᰗᰪ ᰠ ᰕᰰᰶ ᰠᰩᰳ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰙᰨ ᰜ ᰓᰦᰮ ᰉᰧ [38] ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕᰦ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰀᰦᰳ ᰋᰧᰰᰶ ᰆᰩᰵ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰛᰬ ᰅᰫ ᰕᰰᰶ ᰠ ᰠ ᰆᰧ ᰠ ᰃᰬᰵ ᰠ ᰕᰰᰶ ᰓᰪ ᰜᰪᰵ [39] ᰣᰫᰰ ᰏᰨᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰓᰪ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰜᰩᰳ ᰌᰧᰳᰶ ᰛᰤᰬᰳ ᰊᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰠᰦᰵ ᰃᰬ ᰊᰪᰭ ᰓᰨ [40] ᰋᰧᰵᰶ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰡᰧ ᰑᰦᰳ ᰊᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰛᰬ ᰜ ᰚᰨ ᰜ ᰠᰩᰵ ᰙᰩᰭ ᰀ ᰍᰩᰰ [41] ᰍᰫᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰠᰦᰵ ᰃᰬ ᰠᰴ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰡᰧ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰣᰪᰲ ᰜ ᰊᰤᰪᰳ ᰃᰦᰳ ᰎᰦ [42] ᰚᰩᰵ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰆᰧᰰᰶ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰠᰦᰵ ᰃᰬ ᰊᰪᰭ ᰓᰨ ᰋᰧᰵᰶ ᰛᰬ ᰣᰫ ᰡᰩᰱ ᰀᰦᰳ ᰀᰦ [43] ᰜᰤᰩᰭ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰣᰦ ᰛᰧᰵᰶ ᰠᰦᰮ ᰌᰤᰩᰮ ᰜᰧᰭᰶ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰎᰪᰵ ᰀᰨ ᰠᰦᰮ ᰌᰤᰩᰮ [44] ᰋᰩᰱ ᰠ ᰜᰤᰦᰵ ᰀᰦ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰛᰬ ᰠᰦᰭ ᰜᰤᰨᰰ ᰕᰦᰳ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰣᰫᰰ [45] ᰏᰩᰵ ᰍᰪᰰ ᰄᰫ ᰍᰩᰰ ᰍᰬ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰨ ᰊᰬᰳ ᰀᰦ ᰣᰫ ᰡᰩᰱ ᰛᰬ [46] ᰣᰩᰵ ᰀᰦᰳ ᰀᰦ ᰜᰤᰩᰭ ᰓᰦᰰ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰙᰪᰳ ᰀᰦ ᰍᰩᰵ ᰜᰪᰵ [47] ᰌᰧᰵᰶ ᰉᰧ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰎ ᰍᰨ ᰠ ᰣᰫᰰ ᰝᰥᰩᰱ ᰠ ᰊᰬ ᰆᰩᰭ ᰛᰬᰮ [48] ","annotations":[{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"1","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r1","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰍᰩᰵ ᰓᰨ ᰣᰨ ᰚᰩᰵ ᰠᰪ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰨᰮ ᰕᰦ ᰍᰧ ᰎᰬ ᰕᰬ ᰝᰫᰵ ᰝᰥᰧᰶ ᰼","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default#xywh=435,320,2286,158"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"2","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r2","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰃᰨ ᰃᰨᰮ ᰕᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰚᰫᰭ ᰕᰪᰰ ᰌᰦᰮ ᰅᰩᰭ ᰀᰦ ᰃᰨᰮ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰃᰨ ᰙᰨ","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default#xywh=370,462,2399,140"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"3","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r3","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰅᰪᰵ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰙᰩᰮ ᰀᰦ ᰊᰧᰵᰶ ᰙᰪᰰ ᰠ ᰣᰦ ᰙᰩᰮ ᰙᰨ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default#xywh=370,585,2375,148"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"4","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r4","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰃᰨ ᰃᰨᰮ ᰕᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰘᰪ ᰣᰦ ᰅᰧᰰᰶ ᰀᰦ ᰃᰨᰮ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ ᰕ ᰣᰨ ᰼ ᰣᰦ ᰛᰬ ᰃᰨ","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default#xywh=387,720,2388,154"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"5","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r5","type":"Annotation","motivation":"supplementing","body":{"text":"ᰀᰦᰰ ᰜᰪᰵ ᰃᰨ ᰃᰨᰮ ᰕᰪᰵ ᰛᰬ ᰚᰫᰭ ᰕᰪᰰ ᰌᰦᰮ ᰅᰩᰭ ᰀᰦ ᰃᰨ ᰃᰨᰮ ᰎᰦ ᰚᰦᰮ","type":"TextualBody"},"target":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default#xywh=370,864,2381,135"}},{"manifest":"m326357","canvas":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default","mode":"line","line":"6","annotation":{"id":"https:\/\/digitalcollections.universiteitleiden.nl\/iiif_manifest\/item:326411\/canvas\/default\/annotation\/r6","type":"Annotation